        "As for the disambiguation of the entity \u2014 also called the disambiguation of the singular noun \u2014 it is that which removes the ambiguity of a previously mentioned noun whose meaning was general, and it comes after a number e.g. the statement of the Most High: {Indeed, I saw eleven stars} and {The number of months with Allah is twelve months.}\u00b2\u2070\u2074 \u00b2\u2070\u2075 Or after measurements of weight e.g. \u201cI purchased a ratl of oil\u201d, or of capacity e.g. \u201cI purchased an ardab of wheat\u201d, or of area e.g. \u201cI purchased a feddan of land\u201d.\u00b2\u2070\u2076 \u00b2\u2070\u2077",
